'''Bogged''' is a {{Common}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water on [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Spawning ==
'''Bogged''' can be fished up from water on [[Moonglade Marsh]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|level V (5)}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Bogged''' is {{Green|5,000}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|50%|1|2|sea creatures}} with all [[Sea Creatures]] unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase its weight:
